  "engine": "wavetable",
  "comment": "A groove whose sounds move by themselves: the motion recorder plays a filter and resonance lane on the bass that loops every five sixteenths, a twelve-sixteenth Bright lane on the pad and a seven-sixteenth decay lane on the plates - against the four-four beat on the Tight kit they drift apart and meet again. Record your own: LFO mode, Motion. Press Play.",
